      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Build Our Own Higher Ground</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catraâ€™s here, in the Castle. She and Glimmer crashed a small, unfamiliar spaceship the Whispering Woods. No injuries. Glimmerâ€™s fine. Catra was escorted to the spare room and placed in a magic containment circle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Which is why Adoraâ€™s back here, in the middle of the night. To check that their prisoner is secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;â€œGuarding me yourself?â€ Catra asks without opening her eyes, and Adora tenses. Catra rolls onto her back and stretches, arms reaching and back bending. She doesnâ€™t look at Adora. Adora canâ€™t look away from her. â€œDonâ€™t you trust Sparklesâ€™ spellcasting?â€&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
